0,Borgu Fulfulde — Grokipedia,https://grokipedia.com/page/borgu_fulfulde,"Borgu Fulfulde, also known as Benin-Togo Fulfulde or Fulbe-Borgu, is a variety of the Fula language spoken primarily by the Fulani (Fulbe) people as their first language. [1] It belongs to the Niger-Congo language family, specifically the Atlantic-Congo branch, and is classified as a stable indigenous language with a vitality level rated as developing but not endangered. [2] [1] The language ...","Fulfulde, Borgu",Niger-Congo
1,Fulfulde Media,https://fulfuldemedia.com/en,"Welcome to Fulfulde Media, a collection of free downloadable resources in Fulfulde. You can find radio dramas, music, videos and a complete New Testament. The Fulfulde on this site is mostly from Burkina Faso, although there are also some resources in Maasina Fulfulde (Mali) and Niger Fulfulde. Do get in touch with us if you have questions or comments about the materials on this site. News ...","Fulfulde, Borgu",Niger-Congo
2,"Fulfulde, Borgu language - Global Recordings Network",https://globalrecordings.net/en/language/fue,"Fulfulde, Borgu language and dialect information. Audio Bible stories and lessons. Download free evangelism resources, MP3s, audio bible study tools, language/dialect information.","Fulfulde, Borgu",Niger-Congo
3,Fulfulde Media,https://fulfuldemedia.com/,"Bisimilla mooɗon, onon filotooɓe morsooji yeewtere (audio) e morsooji silema (video) gaɗaaɗi e fulfulde. Miɗen calmina on e dow innde Laamɗo. Ley sit amin oon, on tawan fulfulde Burkina, fulfulde Maasina e fulfulde Niger. Waɗooɓe teateriiji, wo yimɓe Laawol Dartiingol, jokkuɓe Laamɗo e dow laawol Iisaa Almasiihu. Jam wonndu e mooɗon. Ndaaree ko heyɗi! Appli Dewtere Laamɗo 4.0 ...","Fulfulde, Borgu",Niger-Congo
4,Fulfulde Repository,https://fulfulde.ng/,"A comprehensive digital platform for documenting, learning, and researching the Fulfulde language and its diverse dialects.","Fulfulde, Borgu",Niger-Congo
5,"Fulfulde Song from Borgou Region of Benin, so good - YouTube",https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=Ja43cUdnKEI,"Fulfulde Song from Borgou Region of Benin, so good : Lets travel to Borgou Benin and here the mesmerizing sounds of Fulfulde music. I try my best to translate the soulful melodies and rhythms.","Fulfulde, Borgu",Niger-Congo
6,"Pulaar/fulfulde. Fulbe music ( fulani, peul) - playlist by Adama | Spotify",https://open.spotify.com/playlist/42FqrtMmWRa4M0CI6AtnHI,"Pulaar/fulfulde. Fulbe music ( fulani, peul) · Playlist · 141 songs · 92 likes","Fulfulde, Borgu",Niger-Congo
7,The Language of African Music: Fulfulde | ALMA,http://alma.matrix.msu.edu/the-language-of-african-music-fulfulde,"The Fulani in Niger all have deep roots in cattle herding and have adjusted to a more semi-nomadic life following decades of desertification, droughts and famines. The seemingly abundant yellow fabric with blue and red shapes unifies the ethnic identity.","Fulfulde, Borgu",Niger-Congo
